ssbook><name>HORIBE, YASUMASA</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KAWABE, TAKASHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KAWAMOTO, TATSUSHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OGAITO, MAKOTO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OHARA, HITOMI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OKUYAMA, HISASHI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>Purified lactide having a high purity is obtained by bringing crude lactide in a solid state or at least partly molten state into contact with ethanol to give a mixture in the form of a slurry and then separating solid matters from the mixture. Lactide for food additives is obtained by recrystallizing crude lactide from optionally denatured ethanol. Lactide has been used in various food additives. Coagulating agents for animal and/or vegetable proteins which contain optically active lactide as the main component; food foaming agents containing lactide as the main component; food preservatives containing lactide as the main component; and pH regulating agents containing lactide as the main component.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention se rapporte à du lactide purifié présentant une grande pureté, que l'on obtient en amenant du lactide brut se trouvant à l'état solide ou au moins dans un état partiellement fondu en contact avec de l'éthanol de manière à produire un mélange se présentant sous la forme d'une suspension épaisse, puis en séparant les matières solides du mélange. On produit du lactide destiné à des additifs alimentaires en recristallisant du lactide brut à partir d'éthanol éventuellement dénaturé. Le lactide a été utilisé dans divers additifs alimentaires. L'invention concerne également des agents coagulants pour animaux et/ou des protéines végétales qui contiennent du lactide optiquement actif en tant que composant principal; des agents gonflants pour mousse alimentaire contenant du lactide en tant que composant principal; des conservateurs alimentaires contenant du lactide en tant que composant principal; et des agents régulateurs de pH contenant du lactide en tant que composant principal.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>